   "payload": {
    "paragraph": "<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Oferim consultatie gratuita si organizam prezentarea echipamentelor si a software-ului in showroom-ul nostru.</strong></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Specialistii nostri:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Va explica in detaliu caracteristicile produselor</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Fac demonstratii practice</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Raspund la toate intrebarile</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Va ajuta sa alegeti solutia potrivita pentru afacerea dumneavoastra</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Selectam echipamente sau solutii software adaptate nevoilor si obiectivelor companiei dumneavoastra.</span></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Pentru informatii suplimentare, sunati la</span> <a href=\"tel:+373 69 116121\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(115, 115, 115);\"><strong>+373 69 116121</strong></a></h3><p><br></p>"
   },
   "createdAt": "2026-02-13T13:30:07.845Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-03-18T11:26:14.026Z",
   "__v": 0
  },
